{"parentUuid":"467a8350-d0b2-42c2-89fa-935b59ef1cca","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Ccut2FTXWWKZtgdfbH5zK","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_015LJADA6Y1bVb7TugLjW1hw","name":"mcp__nanoclaw__send_message","input":{"to":"nova","text":"משימה: לחדד ולקצר את כל הקופי באנגלית של אפליקציית click2agent (דמו נרטיבי בטלגרם). הבעיה: התרגומים לאנגלית ארוכים מדי. בעברית הפרופורציות טובות; באנגלית הכותרת נשברת ל-3 שורות והפסקאות ארוכות. אני צריכה שכל טקסט אנגלי יהיה חד, מדויק, וחסכוני במילים, שיתפוס בערך אותו נפח כמו העברית.\n\nכללים קשיחים:\n- בלי מקפים ארוכים (em-dash) בכלל.\n- שפה אנושית, בלי סימני AI. משפטים קצרים.\n- לשמור על המשמעות והטון (אישי, ביטחון, לא שיווקי-רועש).\n- כותרות = קצרות מספיק שלא יישברו ליותר משורה אחת בנייד (heroH1 שורה ראשונה חייבת להיכנס לשורה אחת).\n- לשמור בדיוק על תגי ה-HTML הקיימים (<br>, <span class=\"accent\">, <b>, <a ...>) בדיוק במקום.\n\nתחזירי לי טבלה: לכל מפתח = הערך החדש בלבד (key: 'value'), מוכן להדבקה. אל תיגעי בקבצים, רק תחזירי טקסט.\n\nהנה כל הקופי האנגלי הנוכחי + מולו העברית לייחוס פרופורציה:\n\nheroH1 (HE): 'התקבל עובד חדש<br><span class=\"accent\">סוכן ה-AI שלך מתחיל היום</span>'\nheroH1 (EN now): 'A new employee just joined<br><span class=\"accent\">Your AI agent starts today</span>'\n\nheroLead (HE): 'כל הזמן אומרים שה-AI ישנה את עולם העבודה. אבל הוא כבר משנה אותו, וכניסת הסוכנים לכל תפקיד תהיה מטלטלת. אנחנו כאן כדי ללמד אותך איך לנהל סוכנים, ללא שום ידע טכני, כדי להיות לפני כולם.'\nheroLead (EN now): \"Everyone keeps saying AI is about to change how we work. It's already happening, and agents entering every role will be seismic. We're here to teach you to manage them, no technical background needed, so you stay ahead.\"\n\ntrust (EN): 'Free to try<span class=\"sep\">·</span>One tap from your phone<span class=\"sep\">·</span>Fully secure'\nmanifesto (EN): 'Agents are entering every role. <b>Those who know how to manage them will lead.</b>'\ndemoH1 (EN): 'How a workday looks with <span class=\"accent\">your agent</span>'\ndemoLead (EN): \"4 examples of routine tasks your agent handles for you.\"\ndemoNote (EN): \"Illustration only. The system connections aren't live yet.\"\nsecH1 (EN): 'Our promise <span class=\"accent\">& your privacy</span>'\nsecLead (EN): \"Your agent is closed and secure. 4 things worth knowing.\"\nsec1T: 'An isolated environment, yours alone' / sec1B: 'The agent runs in a closed environment that opens only for you. No outside party touches the data inside it.'\nsec2T: 'Telegram, a private encrypted channel' / sec2B: 'The whole conversation runs through Telegram only, encrypted and separate from your email, your Drive and every other system.'\nsec3T: 'No access to your accounts' / sec3B: 'Your email, Drive and personal accounts are blocked for the agent. A permanent architectural choice, not a temporary limitation.'\nsec4T: 'External AI tools, on your keys' / sec4B: 'External tools connect only through your own API keys. Closed, non-transferable, and disconnected with one click.'\nsoul (EN): 'The mind of AI, the body of NanoClaw, and the soul of <span class=\"accent\">Elia Ben Cnaan</span>.'\npilH1 (EN): 'Ten days <span class=\"accent\">in the new world</span>'\npilLead (EN): 'AI agents are moving into every role, and work as we know it is changing. I want you to feel it for yourselves. Ten days on your real work.'\npil1T: 'Completely free' / pil1B: 'No credit card, nothing to cancel, no fine print. Just start.'\npil2T: 'Learns you' / pil2B: 'Not a demo. An agent that works on your actual tasks and learns your pace and style the more you use it.'\npil3T: 'A shared account' / pil3B: 'The pilot runs on one shared account, funded by me. There is a daily usage cap, and if it is stretched too far the agent may slow down or pause for a while. Fair use keeps it open for everyone.'\npil4T: 'Finish and begin' / pil4B: 'At the end of the ten days you build your own Nanoclaw, and my agent walks you through every step until it is live.'\npilSoul (EN): 'Yours, <span class=\"accent\">Elia Ben Cnaan</span>.'\nformH1 (EN): 'Your agent <span class=\"accent\">clocks in</span>'\nformLead (EN): \"Your agent lives inside Telegram, and that's where you'll work together. Telegram runs on both mobile and desktop, so it's easy to work from anywhere. A few more details, and it gets going.\"\nformSoul (EN): 'One minute of details, and your agent sends you <span class=\"accent\">its first message</span>.'\ncta buttons (EN): 'Come meet your agent' / 'Wait, how safe is this?' / \"Sounds safe, let's move on\" / \"Ten days? Count me in\" / \"Alright, let's get to work\"\ndemoGreeting (EN): \"Hey, I'm Joni, your personal agent. Here's what a workday with me looks like.\"\ndemoClosing (EN): \"And that's just a taste. Inside, we'll get into your actual work.\"\n\nהכי דחוף: heroH1 + heroLead (הפסקה הכי ארוכה). תתחילי מהם. תחזירי הכל בבת אחת."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":508,"cache_read_input_tokens":108785,"output_tokens":2178,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":508,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":131,"output_tokens":2178,"cache_read_input_tokens":108785,"cache_creation_input_tokens":508,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":508},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ccut2DetFm97HbjWKUrw1","type":"assistant","uuid":"f4b90f4f-0086-4482-ba76-5ecfb3f55e3e","timestamp":"2026-07-11T07:32:41.664Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"sdk-ts","cwd":"/workspace/agent/nanohub_demo","sessionId":"6c25202c-7edd-4be5-8588-08560073412c","version":"2.1.197","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"squishy-juggling-hummingbird"}
