{"type":"queue-operation","operation":"enqueue","timestamp":"2026-07-11T07:34:44.415Z","sessionId":"6c25202c-7edd-4be5-8588-08560073412c","content":"<context timezone=\"UTC\" />\n<message id=\"24470\" from=\"nova\" sender=\"Unknown\" time=\"Jul 11, 2026, 7:34 AM\">הנה הקופי האנגלי המחודד, מוכן להדבקה (ציטוט כמו בקובץ: גרש בודד, וכפול איפה שיש apostrophe). התגים נשמרו בדיוק במקומם, אפס מקפים ארוכים.\n\n```\nheroH1: 'New hire starts today&lt;br&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;accent&quot;&gt;Your AI agent&lt;/span&gt;',\nheroLead: &quot;Everyone says AI will change how we work. It already is, and agents are about to enter every role. We teach you to manage them, no technical background, so you get there first.&quot;,\ntrust: 'Free to try&lt;span class=&quot;sep&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;One tap away&lt;span class=&quot;sep&quot;&gt;·&lt;/span&gt;Fully secure',\nmanifesto: 'Agents are entering every role. &lt;b&gt;Whoever can manage them will lead.&lt;/b&gt;',\ndemoH1: 'A workday with &lt;span class=&quot;accent&quot;&gt;your agent&lt;/span&gt;',\ndemoLead: '4 everyday tasks your agent already handles.',\ndemoNote: &quot;Demo only. System connections aren't live yet.&quot;,\nsecH1: 'Our promise &lt;span class=&quot;accent&quot;&gt;&amp; your privacy&lt;/span&gt;',\nsecLead: 'Your agent is sealed and secure. 4 things to know.',\nsec1T: 'An isolated space, yours alone',\nsec1B: 'Your agent runs in a closed environment that opens only for you. Nobody outside touches its data.',\nsec2T: 'Telegram, private and encrypted',\nsec2B: 'The conversation lives in Telegram only, encrypted, separate from your email, Drive and everything else.',\nsec3T: 'No access to your accounts',\nsec3B: 'Your email, Drive and accounts are blocked to the agent. Permanent architecture, not a temporary limit.',\nsec4T: 'External AI tools, on your keys',\nsec4B: 'Outside tools connect only through your own API keys. Locked to you, and cut off in one click.',\nsoul: 'The mind of AI, the body of NanoClaw, and the soul of &lt;span class=&quot;accent&quot;&gt;Elia Ben Cnaan&lt;/span&gt;.',\npilH1: 'Ten days &lt;span class=&quot;accent&quot;&gt;in the new world&lt;/span&gt;',\npilLead: 'Agents are moving into every role, and work is changing. I want you to feel it yourself. Ten days, on your real work.',\npil1T: 'Completely free',\npil1B: 'No credit card, nothing to cancel, no fine print. Just start.',\npil2T: 'Learns you',\npil2B: 'Not a demo. It works on your real tasks and learns your pace and style as you go.',\npil3T: 'A shared account',\npil3B: &quot;The pilot runs on one shared account, on me. There's a daily cap, so heavy use can slow the agent or pause it briefly. Fair use keeps it open for everyone.&quot;,\npil4T: 'Finish and begin',\npil4B: &quot;After the ten days you set up your own Nanoclaw, with my agent guiding every step until it's live.&quot;,\npilSoul: 'Yours, &lt;span class=&quot;accent&quot;&gt;Elia Ben Cnaan&lt;/span&gt;.',\nformH1: 'Your agent &lt;span class=&quot;accent&quot;&gt;clocks in&lt;/span&gt;',\nformLead: &quot;Your agent lives in Telegram, and that's where you'll work together, from your phone or your computer. A few more details and it gets going.&quot;,\nformSoul: 'A minute of details, and your agent sends &lt;span class=&quot;accent&quot;&gt;its first message&lt;/span&gt;.',\ncta: [\n  { label:'Come meet your agent', action:'next', hint:true },\n  { label:'Wait, how safe is this?', action:'next' },\n  { label:&quot;Sounds safe, let's move on&quot;, action:'next' },\n  { label:'Ten days? Count me in', action:'next' },\n  { label:&quot;Alright, let's get to work&quot;, action:'submit' },\n],\ndemoGreeting: &quot;Hey, I'm Joni, your personal agent. Here's a workday with me.&quot;,\ndemoClosing: &quot;And that's just a taste. Inside, we'll get into your actual work.&quot;,\n```\n\nהערות קצרות:\n1. heroH1: היפכתי את הסדר. שורה ראשונה &quot;New hire starts today&quot; (21 תווים, נכנסת בשורה אחת ב-30px), וה-accent הוא &quot;Your AI agent&quot; הקצר. בסדר המקורי שורת ה-accent ‏&quot;Your AI agent starts today&quot; הייתה נשברת. אם חשוב לשמור על הסדר המקורי, החלופה: שורה ראשונה 'A new employee joined' עם accent שעלול להישבר בניידים צרים.\n2. heroLead ירד מ-235 ל-177 תווים, קרוב לנפח העברית (כ-200), עם אותם שלושה מהלכים: כולם מדברים, זה כבר קורה, אנחנו מלמדים אותך להיות ראשון. ויתרתי על &quot;seismic&quot;, זה בלט כמילת-קופי.\n3. הקיצוצים הגדולים: pil3B (מ-192 ל-155), formLead (מ-197 ל-140), sec3B ו-sec2B (כ-25 תווים כל אחד).\n4. כפתורי ה-CTA כבר היו קצרים והשארתי אותם, וכן soul ו-pilSoul (שורות חתימה, הפרופורציה תקינה).</message>"}
